      "title": "Order recovery by verified prerequisites",
      "eyebrow": "Understand",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The supplied record makes infrastructure readiness a prerequisite for database restoration, and database readiness a prerequisite for resuming the orders application. Place restoration and its verification before each dependent step. Compare the ordered plan with the supplied capabilities and recovery objective: usable service with verified prerequisites. A scheduled dependent step is not ready if earlier restoration remains incomplete.",
          "role": "example",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#tb4"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#f1",
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#f2",
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "These edges describe this exercise, not a universal AWS sequence. If supplied dependencies include independent branches, do not invent an order between them. Listing components is not enough: the plan must show prerequisite order and readiness checkpoints before dependent services resume.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#tb5"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#f2",
              "aws_devops.plan_infrastructure_and_data_restoration_in_dependency_order#f3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
